cate CheckProviderDescriptor accordingly. A4: internal/provider mints errors whose detail embeds canonical filesystem paths, provider IDs, and owner identities and whose Error() appends the cause (provider.go:77-97, trustCandidate, Verify); axerror.refuseCausalLeak (details.go:202-215) will refuse a wire message built from it, so the seam cannot compose when cmd/ax lifts a discovery failure. Restructure provider constructors onto the provhost details-map pattern, or record the composition contract in the package doc.\\\"\\nintegrationCheckpointed = true\\n---KEYS---\\n['ac', 'assignee', 'blockedBy', 'blocks', 'checklist', 'children', 'created', 'derivedBlockedBy', 'derivedBlocks', 'description', 'estimate', 'id', 'integrationCheckpointed', 'isAdvisoryBlocked', 'isBlocked', 'name', 'notes', 'observability', 'outcomeResources', 'parent', 'preconditionResources', 'review', 'scope', 'status', 'task_class', 'title', 'type', 'updated']\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1629,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 408,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
