types are refused.\\n\\nUsage:\\n  task-board worktree checkpoint <ELEMENT-ID> [flags]\\n\\nFlags:\\n  -h, --help   help for checkpoint\\n\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 801,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 201,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
